"Name and role": "Nama dan peran",
"Name to show on the lock screen": "Nama yang ditampilkan di layar kunci",
"Name who approves updates.": "Tunjuk siapa yang menyetujui pembaruan.",
"Names, numbers and addresses are made up. Answers are not saved.": "Nama, nomor, dan alamat adalah rekaan. Jawaban tidak disimpan.",
"National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST), US Department of Commerce": "National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST), US Department of Commerce",
"Needs attention": "Perlu perhatian",
"Never change payment details because of an email alone. Call the supplier on the number you already have.": "Jangan pernah mengubah rincian pembayaran hanya karena email. Telepon pemasok di nomor yang sudah Anda miliki.",
"Never pay a fee to receive money.": "Jangan pernah membayar biaya untuk menerima uang.",
"Never record passwords here; use a password manager for those.": "Jangan pernah mencatat kata sandi di sini; gunakan pengelola kata sandi untuk itu.",
"Never share a sign-in code with anyone, ever.": "Jangan pernah membagikan kode masuk kepada siapa pun.",
"Never store passwords here. Record who manages each account and how its sign-in is protected.": "Jangan pernah menyimpan kata sandi di sini. Catat siapa yang mengelola setiap akun dan bagaimana proses masuknya dilindungi.",
"Never tested": "Belum pernah diuji",
