"Prizes, grants, donations and easy jobs are bait. The catch always comes as a fee, a transfer or your personal details.": "Hadiah, hibah, sumbangan, dan pekerjaan mudah adalah umpan. Jebakannya selalu datang berupa biaya, transfer, atau data pribadi Anda.",
